<title>USA: USDA accepts DEIP bid for whole milk powder.</title>
<headline>USDA accepts DEIP bid for whole milk powder.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Friday it accepted a DEIP bid from P.S. International Ltd to sell 20 tonnes of whole milk powder to the Caribbean, Central and South America.</p>
<p>USDA said the bonus was $1,010 per tonne and delivery was set for March 1-31.</p>
